<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2937; max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 16px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px;">SMTP test email</h2>
    <p>Hi {{.recipient_name}},</p>
    <p>This is a test email from <a href="{{.site_url}}" style="color: #2563eb;">{{.site_name}}</a>.</p>
    <p>If you're seeing this, your SMTP relay is correctly configured — notifications, password resets, and license alerts will reach their recipients.</p>
    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 32px;">
      Triggered by {{.triggered_by}} at {{.triggered_at}}.
    </p>
    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;">
    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px;">{{.site_name}}</p>
  </body>
</html>
